OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FVariable amounts of cloud and
OL,6,Fsome bright or sunny spells. There
OL,7,Fwill be a scattering of showers, these
OL,8,Fmainly across the west. Brisk
OL,9,Fsouthwesterly winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThis evening will see clear
OL,12,Fperiods and a few showers. The rest of
OL,13,Fthe night will become mainly dry but
OL,14,Fstill the odd shower in the west.
OL,15,
OL,16,CSunday:FWidespread rain, occasionally
OL,17,Fheavy, will spread northeast during
OL,18,Fthe morning. Drier and clearer weather
OL,19,Fwill spread from the west by evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
